---
description: Use only relevant installed skills and preserve project custom skills
alwaysApply: true
---

The project's `.cursor/skills` directory is selectively managed.

- use `find-skill` for task-level routing
- do not assume all master-kit skills are installed
- preserve unmanaged/custom project skills
- when stack materially changes, recommend/run project synchronization
- use `.ai-kit/installed-skills.json` as the managed installation manifest
